# Welcome to Niko! Press Run (or Ctrl+Enter) to try it.
# Niko reads like English. Lines starting with # are notes.

say "Hello, world!"

ask "What is your name? " into name
say "Nice to meet you,", name + "!"

to double with x:
    give back x * 2

for each n in numbers 1 to 5:
    say n, "doubled is", double(n)
